A data engineer has ingested a JSON file into a table raw_table with the following schema: transaction_id STRING, payload ARRAY The data engineer wants to efficiently extract the date of each transaction into a table with the following schema: transaction_id STRING, date TIMESTAMP Which of the following commands should the data engineer run to complete this task?
1. SELECT transaction_id, explode(payload) FROM raw_table;
2. SELECT transaction_id, payload.date FROM raw_table;
3. SELECT transaction_id, date FROM raw_table;
4. SELECT transaction_id, payload[date] FROM raw_table;
5. SELECT transaction_id, date from payload FROM raw_table;
